        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Orzo is a small, rice-shaped pasta. It absorbs liquid quickly, so the broth must be added in stages. Stir regularly in the last 10 minutes of cooking or the orzo will stick to the base of the pot." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
